// Default backend URL for the AdaptiveRetirement app target.
//
// The committed default is EMPTY on purpose: no live tunnel domain is baked into the
// repo, so a fresh install runs on the bundled saved calculations only. The team picks
// ONE demo host laptop and ONE ngrok domain per event (see backend/RUNBOOK.md), and
// that host sets the domain in their git-ignored Signing.local.xcconfig:
//
//   SERVER_BASE_URL = https:/$()/your-team.ngrok-free.dev
//
// (The $()/ trick keeps the // from starting a comment.) The value reaches the app as
// the ServerBaseURL Info.plist key; AppStore reads it from there. Testers can still
// override at runtime in Explore › Modeling assumptions › Live calculation — that
// choice is saved on the phone and wins over this build-time default.

SERVER_BASE_URL =
